--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Kokoro-82M (text-to-speech model weights)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Licence: Apache License 2.0
Upstream: https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M

The local TTS service loads the Kokoro-82M weights at runtime. `services/kokoro/app.py` resolves the
repository from the `KOKORO_REPO_ID` environment variable, defaulting to `hexgrad/Kokoro-82M`, and
downloads it from Hugging Face into the cache directory on first use. The weights are **not**
redistributed in this repository and are not baked into the published container images.

The Python `kokoro` package itself is also Apache-2.0 (see `services/kokoro/requirements.txt`).


